{"id":"00950","root":"uni00950_1","name":{"ja":"出雲　きぬ","en":"Izumo Kinu"},"title":{"ja":"【BLACK LAGOON】","en":"【Black Lagoon】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【BLACK LAGOON】 出雲　きぬ","en":"【Black Lagoon】 Izumo Kinu"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2025-10-31","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま一門の対魔忍。木霊を操る木遁遣い。\n木霊は無機物に取り憑いて自在に動かす、武器を強化する、索敵するなど、きぬの望みに応えて様々な働きをしてくれる。\n出雲家はふうま一門の中でも名門であり、突出した忍法使いを何人も輩出している。\nきぬもその一人。\n温和で優しい性格だが怒らせると非常に怖い（絹でもあり鬼怒でもある）。\n同じふうまの対魔忍である佐郷文庫と夫婦となり娘・鶴を生む。","en":"She is a Taimanin of the Fuuma clan, a wood jutsu user who manipulates wood spirits. The wood spirits can possess inorganic objects, move freely, enhance weapons, and perform reconnaissance, all in response to her wishes. The Izumo family is a renowned house within the Fuuma clan, having produced many exceptional ninja. Kinu is one of them. She has a gentle and kind personality, but can be very intimidating when angered, as her name suggests both silk and devil's wrath. She married a fellow Fuuma Taimanin, Bunko, and gave birth to a daughter named Tsuru."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"犬神ひなた","forms":[{"id":"uni00950_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[165,165],"atk":[144,288],"def":[185,370],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","2530196"]},{"id":"uni00950_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[275,275],"atk":[223,446],"def":[305,610],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","2530196","2530197"]},{"id":"uni00950_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2018,4036],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[307,614],"def":[430,860],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","2530196","2530197"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"s